## Overview

The **CAPA AI Module** is a comprehensive multi-agent risk assessment system built with **LangGraph** and **FastAPI**. It orchestrates multiple specialized AI agents to analyze Corrective and Preventive Actions (CAPA) and compute Risk Priority Numbers (RPN).

**Key Features:**
- ✅ Parallel execution of 3 independent agents (Severity, Occurrence, Detection)
- ✅ Intelligent conflict detection between agent assessments
- ✅ Risk Priority Number computation (RPN = Severity × Occurrence × Detection)
- ✅ Multi-agent routing and state management with Redis
- ✅ Comprehensive error handling and retry logic
- ✅ Real-time logging and monitoring

---

## Architecture

### System Diagram

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     CAPA AI Module                              │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                   │
│  FastAPI Server (main:app)                                        │
│  ├─ /orchestrator/analyze  → Orchestrator Service                │
│  ├─ /severity/*            → Severity Agent                       │
│  ├─ /occurrence/*          → Occurrence Agent                     │
│  ├─ /detection/*           → Detection Agent                      │
│  ├─ /question/*            → Question Agent                       │
│  ├─ /regulatory/*          → Regulatory Agent                     │
│  ├─ /cause/*               → Cause Generation Agent               │
│  └─ ... (other agents)                                            │
│                                                                   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
         │
         ├──────────────────────┬──────────────────────┬──────────┐
         ▼                      ▼                      ▼          ▼
    ┌─────────┐          ┌──────────┐          ┌──────────┐  ┌─────┐
    │Severity │          │Occurrence│          │Detection │  │Redis│
    │Agent    │          │Agent     │          │Agent     │  │DB   │
    └─────────┘          └──────────┘          └──────────┘  └─────┘
         │                    │                     │
         └────────────────────┴─────────────────────┘
                      │
                      ▼
            ┌──────────────────────┐
            │Orchestrator Service  │
            │  (LangGraph Graph)   │
            │                      │
            │ 1. Input Validation  │
            │ 2. Parallel Agents   │
            │ 3. Conflict Detect   │
            │ 4. Aggregation (RPN) │
            └──────────────────────┘
                      │
                      ▼
            ┌──────────────────────┐
            │   Response Handler   │
            │  (Risk Assessment)   │
            └──────────────────────┘
```

